AI-slop / low-quality domain blocklist (ai-slop-domains.txt.gz)
==============================================================

A merged snapshot of community-maintained AI-content-farm / low-quality domain lists,
parsed to bare domains. Applied entirely on-device to downrank or hide listed domains;
no query leaves the device for filtering.

Sources (both CC0-1.0, public domain -> compatible with AGPL-3.0 redistribution):

- laylavish/uBlockOrigin-HUGE-AI-Blocklist
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/laylavish/uBlockOrigin-HUGE-AI-Blocklist/main/noai_hosts.txt
  License: CC0-1.0 (public domain)
- agsimmons/ai-content-blocklist
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agsimmons/ai-content-blocklist/refs/heads/main/uBlacklist.txt
  License: CC0-1.0 (public domain)

Regenerate with:  python tools/build_slop_list.py
